      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Some promising types meet in a good race to close. HY (2) returned from a 16-week spell with an authoritative all-the-way win over this distance at Gosford last start. Has only raced three times and is on an upward trajectory. Should take up a lovely position from the favourable draw and is a great chance to go back-to-back. ZOURRIFIC (4) also returned from a spell successfully last time out, just hanging on after leading for the judge over 1000m at Kembla. Gets the run of the race out of the inside stall. Looms as a serious contender. STELLAA LASS (5) last appeared on 25 April when she got the cash in a 1000m Gosford maiden. Trialled twice in preparation for this. Maps favourably just behind the speed and will be hard to hold out. ABSOLUTIST (8) went mad in front last start and capitulated. Back in trip and with no weight might run a cheeky race. Clearly something was amiss with PERFORMANCE (3) last start at the Farm. Subsequent trial winner who can make amends.",
